# Historical evidence is not editable source. Preserve the exact archived blob
# bytes (and its recorded digest), including mixed CRLF/LF, on every platform.
# Normalizing these pre-existing blobs makes a fresh checkout appear dirty and
# incorrectly taints the binary source identity. Do not relax the release gate.
bug-inbox/** -text !eol

